 1. Install [Deno](https://deno.com/)
-2. Add OPENAI_API_KEY to `.env` file in the `server` directory (see `.env.example` for an example)
+2. Add OPENAI_API_KEY to `.env` file in the `server` directory (see `.env.example` for an example) — or use the Web UI's Setup tab instead.
 
